>fiu</span> <span begin="0:43.644" end="0:44.359">și</span> <span begin="0:44.359" end="0:47.220">răbdător,</span></p><p begin="0:47.220" end="0:52.941" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:47.220" end="0:48.491">Pune</span> <span begin="0:48.491" end="0:50.080">strajă</span> <span begin="0:50.080" end="0:51.511">gurii</span> <span begin="0:51.511" end="0:52.941">mele,</span></p><p begin="0:52.941" end="1:00.983" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.941" end="0:55.087">Inimii</span> <span begin="0:55.087" end="0:55.802">să-i</span> <span begin="0:55.802" end="0:56.517">pui</span> <span begin="0:56.517" end="1:00.983">zăvor!</span></p><p begin="1:00.983" end="1:06.504" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.983" end="1:02.363">Doamne,</span> <span begin="1:02.363" end="1:03.053">Tu</span> <span begin="1:03.053" end="1:04.434">mereu</span> <span begin="1:04.434" end="1:06.504">mi-arată</span></p><p begin="1:06.504" end="1:12.025" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.504" end="1:07.884">Limba</span> <span begin="1:07.884" end="1:08.575">mea</span> <span begin="1:08.575" end="1:09.265">cum</span> <span begin="1:09.265" end="1:09.955">să-Ți</span> <span begin="1:09.955" end="1:12.025">închin,</span></p><p begin="1:12.025" end="1:17.547" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.025" end="1:12.716">În</span> <span begin="1:12.716" end="1:14.786">vorbire</span> <span begin="1:14.786" end="1:15.476">să</span> <span begin="1:15.476" end="1:17.547">împartă</span></p><p begin="1:17.547" end="1:23.068" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.547" end="1:19.272">Harul</span> <span begin="1:19.272" end="1:19.617">Tău,</span> <span begin="1:19.617" end="1:20.308">și</span> <span begin="1:20.308" end="1:20.998">nu</span> <span begin="1:20.998" end="1:23.068">venin!</span></p><p begin="1:23.068" end="1:28.590" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.068" end="1:23.758">Iar</span> <span begin="1:23.758" end="1:24.449">la</span> <span begin="1:24.449" end="1:25.829">dreapta</span> <span begin="1:25.829" end="1:28.590">judecată,</span></p><p begin="1:28.590" end="1:34.111" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.590" end="1:31.350">Înaintea</span> <span begin="1:31.350" end="1:32.040">Ta</span> <span begin="1:32.040" end="1:32.731">voi</span> <span begin="1:32.731" end="1:34.111">sta,</span></p><p begin="1:34.111" end="1:39.632" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.111" end="1:34.724">N-aș</span> <span begin="1:34.724" end="1:35.338">vrea</span> <span begin="1:35.338" end="1:36.565">să</span> <span begin="1:36.565" end="1:37.562">ajung</span> <span begin="1:37.562" end="1:39.632">vreodată</span></p><p begin="1:39.632" end="1:47.434" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.632" end="1:41.703">Osândit</span> <span begin="1:41.703" end="1:42.393">de</span> <span begin="1:42.393" end="1:43.773">limba</span> <span begin="1:43.773" end="1:47.434">mea!</span></p><p begin="1:47.434" end="1:52.762" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.434" end="1:48.766">Nimeni</span> <span begin="1:48.766" end="1:49.432">n-a</span> <span begin="1:49.432" end="1:50.764">vorbit</span> <span begin="1:50.764" end="1:51.430">ca</span> <span begin="1:51.430" end="1:52.762">Tine,</span></p><p begin="1:52.762" end="1:58.090" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.762" end="1:54.094">Doamne,</span> <span begin="1:54.094" end="1:54.760">plin</span> <span begin="1:54.760" end="1:55.426">de</span> <span begin="1:55.426" end="1:56.758">Spirit</span> <span begin="1:56.758" end="1:58.090">Sfânt,</span></p><p begin="1:58.090" end="2:03.418" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.090" end="1:59.422">Pune,</span> <span begin="1:59.422" end="2:00.754">astăzi,</span> <span begin="2:00.754" end="2:01.420">și</span> <span begin="2:01.420" end="2:02.086">în</span> <span begin="2:02.086" end="2:03.418">mine</span></p><p begin="2:03.418" end="2:08.746" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.418" end="2:05.416">Dragoste</span> <span begin="2:05.416" end="2:06.082">și-al</span> <span begin="2:06.082" end="2:06.748">Tău</span> <span begin="2:06.748" end="2:08.746">Cuvânt!</span></